Hi <%= @event.user.username %>,

Your training event has been successfully submitted on the SciLifeLab Training Portal and is currently under review by our team.

Next Steps:
- If approved, your training event will be published and visible on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.
- If any changes are required, you will receive an email from one of our admins with details.
- If the event is declined, you will be notified via email with the reason, and it will be removed from the portal.


Event Details:
  Event Title: <%= @event.title %>
  Event URL: <%= @event.url %>
  Start Date: <%= @event.start.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>
  End Date: <%= @event.end.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>

You can view and manage your event using the following link: <%= event_url(@event) %>

Thank you for being an active part of the SciLifeLab community. We value your contributions to making training accessible and impactful!
